module dcr_material_dimension_correct

// D3 decompose-phase POSITIVE twin for PRD `docs/prds/v0_6/dimension-checked-readers.md`
// leaf β (boundary row B4). Identical to `dcr_material_dimension_silent.ri`
// except that `youngs_modulus` carries its declared PRESSURE dimension.
//
// This file must EVAL CLEAN (exit 0) today AND after β lands — β must not
// regress the correct spelling. MEASURED at decompose (2026-07-28,
// main efba5a8036): spring_rate = 1.3802083333333335 m^2*kg*s^-2*rad^-1.
// The dimension TAG became m^2*kg*s^-2*rad^-2 when task #5799 re-dimensioned
